#reason docs/assets/social-preview/README.md Records how to re-render the card so the next edit does not need rediscovering.
#reason docs/assets/social-preview/social-preview.html Gives the repository a branded card source that stays editable and re-renderable.
#reason docs/assets/social-preview/social-preview.png GitHub needs a 1280x640 image to show instead of its generic repository card.
#story The maintainer sets the repository's social preview
#step actor The maintainer
#step action uploads the committed image in the repository settings
#step subject the GitHub repository page
#below interaction Share the repository link and see the Lantern card
#below consequence Links show GitHub's generic card => Links show the Lantern logo and tagline
